@startuml
!include pvapi-theme.iuml
actor "Client" as C
participant "Partner storefront" as S
participant "pvapi" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Browse ==
C -> S : open storefront
S -> API : GET /produtos?token=<consignment UUID>,\n/produtos/:product, /estabelecimentos
API -> DB : public product and shop queries
API --> S : shops, products\n(with pickup locations)
== Cart ==
C -> S : add items, choose a pickup location (retirada) per item
note right of S : cart is frontend state only\n(no cart table or endpoint in pvapi)
== Checkout ==
C -> S : confirm purchase
S -> API : POST /checkouts/confirm\n(Bearer pv_..., items with retirada, client data)
API -> DB : transaction: client, stock, reservations
API --> S : 200 unique_id, qr_codes\n(one per reserved package, with pickup address)
S --> C : show QR codes
== Afterwards ==
C -> API : GET /usuario/cliente/overview (JWT)
API --> C : purchases and pickup data
note over C, API
  Not implemented in this repository: pickup confirmation email,
  callback request, and a QR scan / collection endpoint.
  Reservations stay in status pending.
end note
@enduml
